      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَشَفَ</span></b> , said of a she-camel's dug, <i>Its milk
became drawn up</i> or <i>withdrawn</i> or <i>withheld,</i> or <i>it
went away, from it.</i> (IDrd, L, TA. [See also
4 and 10.])

